AUDIO: 'Every phone on this set is already a camera. Meridian makes it something more. [music] A micro edge compute node. Connect them and you have one [music] complete capture system. Multi- camera cinema, live broadcast, 3D [music] spatial,'

[00:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'bullet time, 4D volutric. Meridian solves what nothing else on the market has. Unified sync and automation. Every millisecond it sweeps every device. [music] verifies every setting and'

[00:28] [scene:talk]
